==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*4 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use a couple of research up [[Cat Combo|combos]]. There are 4 Condemned Pengs spawning in this stage. Use [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] along with [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] to defeat the 4 Condemned Pengs. Once the 4 Condemned Pengs are dead and no longer a risk, summon [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] along with more Bullet Trains to defeat the Sunfish Jones; it is only at a magnification of 100%, so your Awakened Bahamut should be able to survive at least 2 attacks from it.

